2. Terrain heightmaps -- public/terrain/*.png, public/terrain/*.json

   Bundled in this repository. Downsampled (8 m/pixel) from the WARDOGS
   landscape collision data published by the same upstream project
   (wardogs-landscape-collision-u16-v1). These are derived from game data and
   are NOT covered by the MIT License above. Absolute heights use an offset
   datum, so the app only ever displays the difference between two points
   (Delta-Z), never an absolute elevation.

3. Map tiles -- not bundled

   The optional map view loads tiles at runtime from the upstream project's
   asset CDN (assets.wardogs-artillery.com). These are WARDOGS game assets and
   remain the property of their respective copyright holders. No map imagery is
   redistributed in this repository, and the service worker does not cache it.

